     A* (C) Copyright Progressive Data Systems, Inc., 2000
     A*
     A* WFMAP - OUTFILE - WC Payroll info for Policy year
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A* PROGRAM DESCRIPTION:                                          *
     A*                                                               *
     A* OUTPUT FILE from Monthly Interim Report containing Payroll    *
     A* Payroll information for the policy year.                      *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A*                                                               *
     A* REVISIONS:                                                    *
     A*                                                               *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
      *
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
      *
     A          R PMA01                     TEXT('Mnth Intr Rpt Pyroll Outfile')
      *
     A            MACO#     R     S         REFFLD(CO#)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMPANY NUMBER')
      *
     A            MACNAM    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('COMPANY' 'NAME')
      *
     A            MAFND     R     S         REFFLD(FND)
     A                                      COLHDG('FUND')
      *
     A            MAFNAM    R               REFFLD(NM60)
     A                                      COLHDG('GROUP' 'NAME')
      *
     A            MAEMP#    R     S         REFFLD(EMP#)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYER NUMBER')
      *
     A            MADIV     R     S         REFFLD(DIV)
     A                                      COLHDG('DIVISION')
      *
     A            MAENAM    R               REFFLD(NAME)
     A                                      COLHDG('EMPLOYER NAME')
      *
     A            MAFYR     R     S         REFFLD(FYR)
     A                                      COLHDG('POLICY YEAR')
      *
     A            MACLAS         5S 0
     A                                      COLHDG('PAYROLL CLASS')
      *
     A            MASPEC    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('SPECIAL DES')
      *
     A            MAPRDS    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A                                      COLHDG('PAYROLL CLASS' 'DESCRIP')
      *
     A            MAARAT         5S 2
     A                                      COLHDG('ADJUSTED' 'RATE')
      *
      *
     A            MAUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            MAPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            MATIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            MADT      R               REFFLD(DT7S)
      *
